    "title": "📅 Coffee with a Cop at Upper Darby Senior Center Oct. 7",
    "text": "21 hours ago 📅 Coffee with a Cop at Upper Darby Senior Center\nJoin neighbors and local police officers for coffee and conversation at the Upper Darby Senior Center , 326 Watkins Avenue, Upper Darby, PA 19082 .\nDate: Wednesday, October 7, 2026\nTime: 10:00 a.m.–12:00 p.m.\nYou can ask questions, share concerns, and get to know the officers who serve your neighborhood in a relaxed, friendly setting.\nQuestions? Contact Raya Fagg at 610-734-7652 or rfagg@upperdarby.org .\nAll are welcome to stop by and share a cup.\nMore Info: Coffee with a Cop • Upper Darby, PA\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
